      "content": "It is incredibly painful to feel utterly depleted and like your efforts are meaningless in the face of constant motion. When everything feels worn out and like it's just routine, that sense of hopelessness can feel absolute. Please remember that even a small pause can shift perspective, and there are people who want to help you find a way through this heavy feeling. Could you consider connecting with a crisis line right now to talk about these deep feelings?",
      "source": "target",
